entries[124339] = { ["name"] = "Greaves of the Ceaseless Vigil", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nLegs Plate\n15 Armor\n+5 [Strength or Intellect]\n+7 Stamina\n+ 5 Critical Strike\n+ 4 Mastery\nDurability 120 / 120\nClasses: Paladin\nWatch of the Ceaseless Vigil (0/5)\nCuirass of the Ceaseless Vigil\nGauntlets of the Ceaseless Vigil\nHelm of the Ceaseless Vigil\nGreaves of the Ceaseless Vigil\nShoulderplates of the Ceaseless Vigil\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Holy: Increases the amount of healing transferred to your Beacon of Light targets by 25%.\n(2) Set Protection: When you cast Avenger's Shield, you gain an absorb effect equal to 5.0% of your maximum health for 10 sec.\n(2) Set Retribution: Increases all damage you do by 2%.\n(4) Set Holy: Your spell haste is increased by 2% every time you heal your Beacon of Light target. Lasts for 6 sec. Stacks up to 4 times.\n(4) Set Protection: Your Avenger's Shield has a 50% chance to have it's cooldown instantly reset when used. (Proc chance: 50%)\n(4) Set Retribution: After using Avenging Wrath, your damage is increased by 5% every 1 sec for 10 sec.\nSell Price:" }
