entries[125000] = { ["name"] = "Wild Combatant's Satin Gloves", ["text"] = "Warlords Season 2\nBinds when picked up\nHands Cloth\n2 Armor\n+3 Intellect\n+5 Stamina\n+ 3 Haste\n+ 3 Mastery\nDurability 50 / 50\nClasses: Priest\nRequires any Alliance race\nGladiator's Investiture (0/5)\nGladiator's Satin Robe\nGladiator's Satin Hood\nGladiator's Satin Gloves\nGladiator's Satin Mantle\nGladiator's Satin Leggings\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Discipline: Penance now increases the movement speed of a friendly target you heal by 30%, and decreases the movement speed of an enemy target you damage by 50%.\n(2) Set Holy: When Prayer of Mending heals a target, you and the target gain 20 Versatility for 10 sec. Stacks up to 5 times.\n(2) Set Shadow: When Dispersion ends, you gain 300 Versatility for 10 sec.\n(4) Set Discipline: Reduces the cooldown of Pain Suppression by 60 sec.\n(4) Set Holy: Reduces the cooldown of Guardian Spirit by 60 sec.\n(4) Set Shadow: When you use Silence, you gain 30 Insanity.\nSell Price:" }
