entries[125096] = { ["name"] = "Wild Aspirant's Silk Handguards", ["text"] = "Warlords Season 2\nBinds when picked up\nHands Cloth\n2 Armor\n+3 Intellect\n+5 Stamina\n+ 3 Critical Strike\n+ 3 Haste\nDurability 40 / 40\nClasses: Mage\nRequires any Alliance race\nGladiator's Regalia (0/5)\nGladiator's Silk Robe\nGladiator's Silk Cowl\nGladiator's Silk Handguards\nGladiator's Silk Amice\nGladiator's Silk Trousers\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Arcane: Successfully Spellstealing a buff generates a use of Arcane Missiles.\n(2) Set Fire: Casting Scorch reduces the cast time and increases the critical strike chance of Fireball by 15%, stacking up to 3 times.\n(2) Set Frost: When you cast Cone of Cold, a patch of ice is left on the ground below the target area for 6 sec, slowing any enemies in the area by 50%.\n(4) Set Arcane: While Arcane Power is active, you can cast Arcane Blast and Arcane Missiles while moving.\n(4) Set Fire: When you consume Hot Streak, your Pyroblast target has a 15% increased chance to be critically hit by your Fireball spell for 10 sec.\n(4) Set Frost: Frostbolt deals 50% increased damage to snared targets.\nSell Price:" }
